  translation {
    text: "Route will be extended to directly serve the Community College of Aurora from Aurora Metro Center on select trips, with a new routing that includes several turns through Centrepoint, Alameda, Chambers, and Centretech Parkway. The return route will follow the same streets in reverse, while service west of Aurora Metro Center will remain unchanged. "
